      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GRAMERCY BEAT (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (30.13) at Q Parklands behind Let Him Loose in a Grade 5. Chased the leaders and with a clean run can be prominent. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Top chance in this line up. TOP THE LOT (8) finished in the placings last time but could not have been more impressive before that in his blistering 21.62 win at this track over 390m. Has the ability and looks a key chance. GOLDSTAR RODNEY (3) comes off an average run last start when fifth at this track over 352m behind Need An Uber (20.21) in a Grade 5. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Has the ability to give this a shake. MAYWYN'S CHIEF (2) was out of the money here last time out but can bounce back.",
